WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:07.960
It's common knowledge that the inhumanities
carried out by the Nazi party under the reign

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:13.130
of Adolf Hitler during the second wold war
were unspeakably horrific.

00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:23.650
But here's some little known facts about Hitler
and the Nazi party that you may not know.

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:27.789
1.

00:00:27.789 --> 00:00:33.900
During World War II, Nazi scientists developed
an experimental cocktail of drugs, containing

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:38.120
oxycodone, cocaine and methamphetamine.

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:44.671
When they gave the cocktail to test subjects
they gained almost superhuman powers and were

00:00:44.671 --> 00:00:52.650
able to march over 90 kilometres a day, whilst
carrying a 20 kilogram backpack, without any

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:53.650
fatigue.

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:54.650
2.

00:00:54.650 --> 00:01:02.129
When Berlin fell two Nazi submarines declined
to surrender and instead remained submerged

00:01:02.129 --> 00:01:09.750
for two months before landing in Argentina,
one is said to have offloaded a Nazi officer

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:11.580
before it was detected.

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:12.580
3.

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:19.660
In 1945, US president Dwight D. Eisenhower
predicted that people would try to dispel

00:01:19.660 --> 00:01:23.880
the fact that the holocaust ever actually
happened.

00:01:23.880 --> 00:01:31.060
So he ordered innumerable pictures to be taken
of the Nazi crimes to hinder any such attempts.

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:32.060
4.

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:40.160
A German soldier during WW2 called Werner
Goldberg was branded "The Ideal German Soldier"

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:42.480
because of his physical appearance.

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:44.790
Ironically he was half Jewish.

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:45.790
5.

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:47.930
The Nazis were animal lovers.

00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:54.300
Many Nazi leaders, including Hitler and Hermann
Göring, were ardent supporters of animal

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:56.350
rights and conservation.

00:01:56.350 --> 00:02:02.650
The Nazi party even introduced animal protection
laws and laws that limited the hunting of

00:02:02.650 --> 00:02:04.260
animals.

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:09.280
Hitler himself even became a vegetarian towards
the later stages of his life.

00:02:09.280 --> 00:02:11.200
It's just a shame they didn't realise that
humans are animals too.

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:12.200
6.

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:16.980
In 1939 the Nazis formed a plan to counterfeit
the British pound to cause hyperinflation

00:02:16.980 --> 00:02:21.129
and send the British economy into meltdown.

00:02:21.129 --> 00:02:29.181
Using a German concentration camp, they manufactured
over 132 million British Pound Sterling, which

00:02:29.181 --> 00:02:33.090
is the equivalent of 7 billion pounds today.

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:35.720
Their plan was a partial success.

00:02:35.720 --> 00:02:36.720
7.

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:42.480
The Nazis believed that Germans as a race
were superior to all other human beings.

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:46.829
But it wasn't only Germans that became Nazis.

00:02:46.829 --> 00:02:52.530
The Nazis kidnapped hundreds of thousands
of Polish children whom they deemed to be

00:02:52.530 --> 00:02:57.519
racially superior and forcibly Germanised
them.

00:02:57.519 --> 00:03:02.510
After the war ended only 10% of them ever
returned to Poland.

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:06.319
Which is a striking example of the Nazis brainwashing
power.

00:03:06.319 --> 00:03:07.319
8.

00:03:07.319 --> 00:03:10.590
The Nazis were obsessed with invading Switzerland.

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:14.980
It's no secret the Nazis were always fond
of a good invasion.

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:22.719
By June 1941 they had invaded and occupied
Belgium, the Netherlands, Luxembourg, France,

00:03:22.719 --> 00:03:27.599
Greece, Denmark, Yugoslavia, Norway and Poland.

00:03:27.599 --> 00:03:33.700
Switzerland however has a famous, long standing
neutrality, it never takes sides.

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:38.120
But the Nazis had no intentions of respecting
that.

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:42.989
Hitler hated Switzerland, he called it "A
pimple on the face of Europe".

00:03:42.989 --> 00:03:48.790
They put all their efforts into invading it,
but it wasn't an easy task, due to Switzerland

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:54.560
being surrounded by perilous mountains, so
they eventually gave up.

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:55.560
9.

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:57.419
Hitler loved a good joke.

00:03:57.419 --> 00:04:02.659
Hitler had a small collection of favourite
jokes that he enjoyed telling over and over

00:04:02.659 --> 00:04:03.659
again.

00:04:03.659 --> 00:04:05.769
His all time favourite was:

00:04:05.769 --> 00:04:11.989
One day, Mrs. Goering came into the bedchamber
and found her husband waving his Field Marshall‘s

00:04:11.989 --> 00:04:14.069
baton over his underwear.

00:04:14.069 --> 00:04:17.650
“Hermann, darling, what are you doing?”
she enquired.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:21.140
“I am promoting my underpants to overpants!”

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:22.290
10.

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:30.250
The German's gravely feared and hated secret
police force, the Gestapo, was headed by Heinrich

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:31.570
Müller.

00:04:31.570 --> 00:04:38.440
Widely regarded as a purely evil individual
who presided over countless tortures and executions

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:39.840
during the war.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:47.350
Müller was seen in Hitler's bunker the day
after his suicide, but after that he completely

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:50.660
vanished, never to be seen again.

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:56.820
To this day his is the most senior member
of the Nazi regime who's whereabouts are not

00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:58.170
known.

00:04:58.170 --> 00:05:03.560
Many people involved with the Nazi regime
have said they believe he is still alive and

00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:06.820
it is rumoured he escaped to South America.

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:10.330
But he still manages to elude police detectives.

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:11.330
11.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:18.040
When the Nazi party held its first book burning,
one of the works destroyed was a 1821 play

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:24.380
by Heinrich Heine, which contained the famous
line: "When they burn books, they will in

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:26.640
the end, also burn people."

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:27.640
12.

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:34.830
The United States gave asylum to Nazi war
criminals for decades and subsequently tried

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:40.220
to cover it up until they were sued under
the Freedom of Information Act.

00:05:40.220 --> 00:05:41.220
13.

00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:46.660
Although widely disputed, it is thought that
Nazi doctors were the first to identify the

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:50.660
link between smoking and lung cancer.

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:57.110
Because of this the Nazis were very anti-smoking
and launched one of the first ever known anti-smoking

00:05:57.110 --> 00:05:58.130
campaigns.

00:05:58.130 --> 00:05:59.140
14.

00:05:59.140 --> 00:06:06.700
The Nazis tried to cure homosexuality by forcing
homosexual inmates to have sex with female

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:07.910
sex slaves.

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:08.910
15.

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:13.120
Coco Chanel, founder of the Chanel Brand was
a Nazi Spy.

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:19.190
Chanel loved power, so naturally she found
a home amongst the Nazi officials.

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:26.270
Not only did Chanel steal her famous perfume,
Chanel No.5 from the Jewish family that financed

00:06:26.270 --> 00:06:29.591
it, but she also got them to pay her living
expenses.

00:06:29.591 --> 00:06:30.591
16.

00:06:30.591 --> 00:06:38.080
The Nazis planned to turn the whole of Moscow
and Warsaw into artificial lakes.

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:39.090
17.

00:06:39.090 --> 00:06:43.830
The Nazis were responsible for a lot of advances
in technology.

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:49.290
Hitler commissioned the designer of porsche
to create an everyday car that looked like

00:06:49.290 --> 00:06:50.560
a beetle.

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:55.540
This was the start of Volkswagen, literally
meaning "People's Car".

00:06:55.540 --> 00:07:01.760
The new car was a huge success and became
one of the most popular vehicles in the world.

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:02.760
18.

00:07:02.760 --> 00:07:08.220
Hitler was also an enthusiastic supporter
for the construction of autobahns, he pushed

00:07:08.220 --> 00:07:13.290
for the world's largest network of roads to
be built across Germany.

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:20.140
Being the first ever freeway system the autobahn
was a legendary feat of engineering that has

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:22.870
since been emulated by Britain and America.

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:23.870
19.

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:29.860
A member of the Nazi party was also responsible
for creating modern day rocketry as we know

00:07:29.860 --> 00:07:30.860
it.

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:36.870
Aerospace engineer Wernher Von Braun, was
a member of the Nazi party who basically fathered

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:39.120
modern day rocketry.

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:45.760
Since WW2 he has become a U.S. citizen working
at NASA, and he developed the Saturn V booster

00:07:45.760 --> 00:07:49.480
rocket, that helped man finally reach the
moon.

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:50.480
20.

00:07:50.480 --> 00:07:56.530
After the Second World War, more than 7,000
Nazi sympathisers committed suicide.

00:07:56.530 --> 00:07:57.530
21.

00:07:57.530 --> 00:08:04.040
In addition to six million jews, the Nazis
also killed an equal number of Christians,

00:08:04.040 --> 00:08:08.780
Catholics and Homosexuals inside concentration
camps.

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:09.780
22.

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:15.900
And finally, pretty much every Nazi official
who knew Hitler didn't like his moustache.

00:08:15.900 --> 00:08:18.030
But Hitler loved it.

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:24.090
His secretary once outwardly told him that
she didn't like his moustache, to which Hitler

00:08:24.090 --> 00:08:31.060
replied "If the moustache is not a trend now,
it will become one soon because I am wearing

00:08:31.060 --> 00:08:34.419
it."

